Hello fellow dance enthusiasts, it is party week and I am very excited! With the last week of term and for 2014 now here it is just amazing how quickly this year has gone and how much has happened. Details for the end of year party and concert are below, the performances are featuring Rhythm Culture with their contagious rhythms amazing drumming students, Bella Belly Dancing in all their mesmerising grace and elegance and of course Free Spirit Dance & Music with the joy and excitement they always bring. I look forward to seeing you at the Party!! **End of Year Concert/Party 6th December –Tickets** **on sale** Come and let your hair down at this fantastic event to celebrate a year well done! There will be featured performances from Free Spirit Dance & Music (of course), Bella Belly Dancing and live drumming and music from Rhythm Culture! The evening will run from 6-9pm,there will be an hour of performing with nibbles provided. Drinks/beverages alcoholic and non alcoholic can be purchase for a small cost Tickets are available to the public and are $15pp when pre-booked online or $20pp when purchase on the night at the door. The venue is Northshore community Centre, in Mudjimba, which is a wonderful venue for a classy affair. Get in quick and book your tickets now via this link: [http://events.ticketbooth.com.au/event/CulturalInfusionEndofYearParty](http://events.ticketbooth.com.au/event/CulturalInfusionEndofYearParty) or by clicking on the image below:
